  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Lang Ya blessed land is attacked, Lang Ya land spirit activates Twelve Wave Cloud Confusion Formation. The twelve cloud buildings are all mortal Gu Houses and serve as formation cores. Fang Yuan judges the cloud buildings as only mortal Gu Houses, and therefore hard pressed to obstruct strong invaders while also protecting the buildings.",
      "chapters": [
        872
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "sys_twelve_wave_cloud_confusion_formation",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan and the others first defend the mortal Gu house cloud buildings, but Shadow Sect destroys them and breaks the twelve wave cloud confusion formation. In the same battle recount, Lang Ya land spirit keeps hairy man Gu Immortals hidden inside the rank eight Immortal Gu House Refinement Cauldron, and Hei Cheng uses the Immortal Gu House Dark Prison against Heavenly Giant Solor.",
      "chapters": [
        980
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "broken-cores-beside-immortal-houses",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "house_refinement_cauldron",
        "char_hei_cheng",
        "house_dark_prison",
        "sys_heavenly_giant_solor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On Cloud Cover Continent, twelve cloud cities each count as a mortal Gu House. Activated together they form the twelve wave cloud confusion formation covering the continent, upgraded from the former twelve cloud buildings.",
      "chapters": [
        1074
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cloud-cities",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_cloud_cover_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Hei Fan grotto-heaven, Chen Chi’s entire group of palaces is a huge mortal Gu House, so Fang Yuan’s actions there stay under Chen Chi’s observation.",
      "chapters": [
        1123
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "palace-complex",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hei_fan_grotto_heaven",
        "char_chen_chi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Broader Gu house dwellings are covered on Gu House. Immortal-rank Houses are covered on Immortal Gu House.",
